From 2cf923de838c043b268139fd12b991ba0c124fd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jeffrey <jeffrey@SparkThree.vpn.dk>
Date: Sat, 16 May 2026 11:26:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] fork: Section 5 - Qwen3-Coder-Next (qwen3_next) model
 profile

Qwen3-Coder-Next is a hybrid Gated Delta Networks + sparse MoE architecture
(model_type: 'qwen3_next'). The checkpoint stores per-expert 2D tensors but the
live HF model holds 3D packed nn.Parameters. The streaming loader's _fast_install
failed because the install resolver (built from named_parameters on the meta
skeleton) expects packed keys but the checkpoint has per-expert keys.

model_profiles/base.py: add no-op pack_checkpoint_expert_tensors(layer_prefix,
tensors) default to ModelProfile base class.

model_profiles/qwen3_next.py: new Qwen3NextProfile with:
- matches(): catches model_type='qwen3_next' and Qwen3Next* architectures
- serving_profile_id(): returns 'vllm_qwen3_5_packed_moe' for allocator audit
- fused_sibling_group(): vLLM packed_modules_mapping + fallback dict
- pack_checkpoint_expert_tensors(): packs 512x{gate|up}_proj -> gate_up_proj
  and 512xdown_proj -> down_proj (3D packed tensors for _fast_install)
- packed_expert_param_names(), per_expert_moe_regex(), split_packed_experts_for_format()

model_profiles/registry.py + __init__.py: register Qwen3NextProfile before
Qwen3 siblings (distinct model_type avoids any overlap).

streaming_model.py: StreamingContext gains profile field; _build_streaming_context
calls detect_profile and stores it; both _prefetch_worker and ensure_loaded call
profile.pack_checkpoint_expert_tensors after _read_layer_to_device.
